# Reviewed data files are tracked (data/curation/, data/decisions/) and are read
# by tools that compare them byte-for-byte. A checkout on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true would rewrite every line ending and make the next diff look
# like the whole file changed.
#
# RUNBOOK's Windows notes flagged this as a reason data/ was git-ignored; these
# two directories are no longer ignored, so the guard moves here.
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
